cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below and this repository."
title: "PTRE: Pseudo-Time Reconstruction for Epidemics"
abstract: "An analytical pipeline that constructs a one-dimensional latent ordering of confirmed cases from contact-tracing records by integrating individual-level attributes with contact-network summaries, in order to refine transmission-direction inference under onset-time ambiguity."
authors:
